  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> both have <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> configuration. Thus",
