  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"82\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0098591_Ans_1.jpg\" width=\"300\" /><br /><br />Extra stability is gained when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is reduced to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> and is thus an oxidizing agent.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&rarr;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"69\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0098591_Ans_2.jpg\" width=\"430\" />",
